.TH STEF 1 "September 2026" "stef 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
stef \- SOPS-aware grep with encrypted match history
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B stef
.RI [ OPTIONS ] " PATTERN " [ PATH ...]
.br
.B stef
.RI [ OPTIONS ] " -e PATTERN " [ PATH ...]
.br
.B stef -p
.RI [ DURATION ] " [PATTERN [PATH ...]]"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B stef
is a standalone search tool built with reusable Rust crates from the
ripgrep project. It searches ordinary files directly and transparently invokes
.B sops --decrypt FILE
for SOPS-encrypted files. Decrypted contents are searched from a pipe and are
not written to a stef temporary file.
.PP
Normal searches can be retained as encrypted match-only snapshots. Pass mode
compares the current result with earlier snapshots and renders disappeared
matches as removals and new matches as additions.
.SH COMMON SEARCH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR -e ", " --regexp " PATTERN"
Add a search pattern. Repeatable.
.TP
.BR -f ", " --file " FILE"
Read patterns from FILE, one per line.
.TP
.BR -F ", " --fixed-strings
Treat patterns literally.
.TP
.BR -i ", " --ignore-case
Case-insensitive search.
.TP
.BR -S ", " --smart-case
Ignore case unless an uppercase literal appears in the pattern.
.TP
.BR -w ", " --word-regexp
Require word-boundary matches.
.TP
.BR -x ", " --line-regexp
Match complete lines.
.TP
.BR -v ", " --invert-match
Report non-matching lines.
.TP
.BR -U ", " --multiline
Permit matches across line boundaries.
.TP
.BR -A " N, " -B " N, " -C " N"
Show after, before, or surrounding context.
.TP
.BR -r ", " --recursive
Recurse into directory operands. Without -r or -R, directory operands are not searched.
.TP
.B -R
Recursive search and follow symbolic links (GNU grep-compatible behaviour).
.TP
.BR -u ", " --unrestricted
Relax filters. -u disables ignore rules; -uu also includes hidden paths;
-uuu also searches binary-looking data as text.
.TP
.BR -g ", " --glob " GLOB"
Apply an override glob.
.TP
.BR -t ", " --type " TYPE"
Search a named file type.
.TP
.BR -T ", " --type-not " TYPE"
Exclude a named file type.
.TP
.B --hidden
Search hidden files and directories.
.TP
.B --no-ignore
Disable ignore-file filtering.
.TP
.B --follow
Follow symbolic links.
.SH SOPS OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --sops-glob " GLOB"
Add a filename glob to the SOPS candidate set.
.TP
.B --no-sops
Disable SOPS probing/decryption.
.PP
The SOPS executable defaults to
.B sops
and can be overridden with
.BR STEF_SOPS .
.SH HISTORY AND PASS MODE
.TP
.BR -p ", " --pass
Compare the current result with the most recent distinct previous match state.
With no PATTERN/PATH, rerun the most recently remembered search from its
original working directory.
.TP
.BI -p " 7d"
Compare against all historical matches seen for the same search within a time
window. Supported suffixes are m, h, d and w.
.TP
.B --no-history
Do not retain this run.
.TP
.B --history
List recent remembered commands and metadata. Stored match text is not printed.
.TP
.B --clear-history
Delete snapshots and compact the history database.
.TP
.BI --history-gpg-recipient " KEY"
Wrap the stef history master key to a local GPG secret key. Repeatable.
.SH OUTPUT OPTIONS
.TP
.BR -N ", " --no-line-number
Suppress line numbers.
.TP
.BR -o ", " --only-matching
Print only matching substrings.
.TP
.BR -c ", " --count
Print matching-line counts per file.
.TP
.B --count-matches
Print submatch counts per file.
.TP
.BR -l ", " --files-with-matches
Print matching filenames only.
.TP
.BR -L ", " --files-without-match
Print non-matching filenames only.
.TP
.BR -q ", " --quiet
Suppress normal output and use the exit status.
.TP
.B --json
Emit newline-delimited JSON match and summary records.
.TP
.B --vimgrep
Print path:line:column:text.
.TP
.BI --color " auto|always|never"
Control ANSI colour.
.SH STATE
History is stored under STEF_STATE_DIR, otherwise XDG_STATE_HOME/stef,
otherwise ~/.local/state/stef.
.PP
Match payloads are encrypted with ChaCha20-Poly1305. When a locally usable PGP
recipient is discovered in SOPS metadata, the random master key can be wrapped
with GPG as history.key.gpg. Otherwise a mode-0600 local history.key is used.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B STEF_STATE_DIR
History directory override.
.TP
.B STEF_HISTORY_GPG_RECIPIENT
Comma-separated GPG recipient selectors.
.TP
.B STEF_SOPS
SOPS executable override.
.TP
.B STEF_GPG
GPG executable override.
.TP
.B NO_COLOR
Disable automatic terminal colour.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 if a match was found, 1 if no match was found, 2 on error.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR grep (1),
.BR rg (1),
.BR sops (1),
.BR gpg (1)
.SH AUTHOR
The stef project.
